member.summary:
Inline editor for asset-reference pins. Shows the asset name in a button;
clicking opens the host asset picker. Hosts should register a type-specific
override with picker-registry access for full UX.

Registry of  instances.
Providers are iterated in descending  order;
the first whose  returns true wins.

In-memory store for starred ("favorite") picker entries, keyed by context key + item key.
When IEditorHostServices.Preferences is available the host may persist these externally;
this fallback keeps them for the duration of the session only.
